OL,3,AEngland's shoplifting problem and the
OL,4,Aprolific offenders fuelling it
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoplifting is now firmly in the past
OL,7,Ffor Ashman, but prolific shoplifters
OL,8,Flike him continue to plague communities
OL,9,Facross England.
